  - entityId: npc_balthazar
    displayName: Balthazar
    subtitle: Underground Curio Merchant
    entityType: 1
    arcana: 15
    arcanaTitle: THE DEVIL
    portraitSpriteName: Mockup_PersonaPortrait_Merchant.png
    loreDescription: Cunning shadow trader lurking in the subterranean vaults. Driven
      purely by profit, gems, and priceless relics.
    currentAffinity: 10
    socialLinkRank: 2
    currentMood: 2
    lovedGiftIds:
    - mat_ruby
    - potion_elixir
    - spire_gold_sack
    likedGiftIds:
    - potion_amber
    - weapon_staff
    dislikedGiftIds:
    - relic_whetstone
    hatedGiftIds:
    - counterfeit_coin
    - worthless_slag
    lovedGiftLine: Heheheh! Ah, now THAT's the glittering sparkle of true currency!
      You've got an eye for exquisite value, friend!
    likedGiftLine: A fine offering. I reckon I can flip this on the black market
      for a tidy margin.
    neutralGiftLine: Fair enough. All goods carry a price in the subterranean markets.
    dislikedGiftLine: Too crude, too rustic! What am I supposed to do with this utilitarian
      junk?
    hatedGiftLine: You dare present me counterfeit trash?! The nerve! My wares just
      doubled in price for you, ingrate!
    rankUpLine: A blood pact written in golden ink... The Devil smiles upon our mutually
      profitable conspiracy!
    chatBranches:
    - promptDialogue: 'Tell me true, traveler: when you gaze into the abyss of the
        Spire, what do you crave most?'
      choiceOptionA: Wealth and forbidden relics beyond mortal reckoning.
      reactionDialogueA: Kwahaha! Spoken like a true soul of ambition! We shall get
        along swimmingly!
      affinityDeltaA: 15
      moodA: 0
      choiceOptionB: Righteous honor and selfless protection of the weak.
      reactionDialogueB: Pah! Naive sentimentality won't buy bread in the Under-spire.
      affinityDeltaB: -8
      moodB: 5
    positiveBuff:
      id: buff_balthazar
      title: Shadow Consignment
