    lovedGiftLine: '*Caw-caw!* Sparkly ruby! Precious shiny! My nest shall gleam
      like the Astral Heavens!'
    likedGiftLine: '*Flutters wings* Sweet ether draught! Corvus tastes the currents
      of magic!'
    neutralGiftLine: '*Tilts head with curiosity* A modest trinket. Corvus shall
      inspect it with keen eyes.'
    dislikedGiftLine: '*Pecks angrily* Heavy! Drab! Corvus wants glitter, not dull
      lead weights!'
    hatedGiftLine: '*Furious shrieking* Begone! Put that hideous thing away before
      I claw your hair!'
    rankUpLine: The wings of fate beat with arcane resonance! The Magician grants
      thee uncanny critical precision!
    chatBranches:
