      reactionDialogueA: '*Flaps enthusiastically* Yes! Shiny! Master knows Corvus''s
        heart!'
      affinityDeltaA: 12
      moodA: 0
      choiceOptionB: Forget shinies, keep a lookout for lethal spike traps.
      reactionDialogueB: '*Sighs and ruffles feathers* Boring... always duty, never
